#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:5 42ce4868d4aa43f1900b9db560ebeaa7
msgid "Loiter Mode"
msgstr "Loiter模式"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:7 c6d915d993fd40979b6af2c761392b4a
msgid ""
"Loiter Mode automatically attempts to maintain the current location, heading"
" and altitude. The pilot may fly the copter in Loiter mode as if it were in "
"a more manual flight mode but when the sticks are released, the vehicle will"
" slow to a stop and hold position."
msgstr "Loiter模式自动尝试保持当前位置、航向和高度。飞手可以像手动飞行模式一样操控飞机，但当摇杆松开后，飞行器将减速停止并保持位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:9 3a60be83968b44fca5d09d650642e2aa
msgid ""
"A good GPS lock, :ref:`low magnetic interference on the compass <common-"
"diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>` and :ref:`low "
"vibrations <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_vibrations>` are all "
"important in achieving good loiter performance."
msgstr ""
"良好的GPS锁定、:ref:`低罗盘磁干扰 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_compass_interference>` 以及 :ref:`低震动 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_vibrations>` 对于实现良好的Loiter性能都非常重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:16 d7f4cbfbeda44b5d9d6f118019223449
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "操控"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:18 fc1d4a4eb0114086b5f88903b36dad8e
msgid "The pilot can control the copter's position with the control sticks."
msgstr "飞手可以通过控制摇杆调整飞行器位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:20 85256fd454e847f89671f777df7fb539
msgid ""
"Horizontal location can be adjusted with the Roll and Pitch control sticks "
"with the default maximum horizontal speed being 5m/s (see Tuning section "
"below on how to adjust this).  When the pilot releases the sticks the copter"
" will slow to a stop."
msgstr "水平位置可通过横滚和俯仰控制摇杆调整，默认最大水平速度为5m/s（调整方法见下方调参部分）。飞手松开摇杆后飞机将减速停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:24 a03faac9f39d4e5aa53d2c07e324adcc
msgid ""
"Altitude can be controlled with the Throttle control stick just as in "
":ref:`AltHold mode <altholdmode_controls>`"
msgstr "高度可通过油门控制摇杆进行控制，与 :ref:`AltHold模式 <altholdmode_controls>` 相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:26 35a749e5fef14fd6a9a52d80ee09d04e
msgid "The heading can be set with the Yaw control stick"
msgstr "航向可通过偏航控制摇杆设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:28 6b1fbd0f74654791b7d03e2161fb9ac4
msgid ""
"The vehicle can be armed in Loiter mode but only once the GPS has 3D lock "
"and the HDOP has dropped below 1.4.  :ref:`More details on LED patterns here"
" <common-leds-pixhawk>`. If using another position source like optical flow "
"or another :ref:`Non-GPS Navigation source <common-non-gps-navigation-"
"landing-page>`, setting an EKF origin via GCS is enough, provided the "
"positioning source functions satisfactorily. This enables use of Loiter "
"indoors."
msgstr ""
"机体可以在 Loiter 模式下解锁，但必须等 GPS 获得 3D 锁定且 HDOP 降到 1.4 以下。:ref:`更多 LED 指示模式的详情见此 "
"<common-leds-pixhawk>`。如果使用其他位置源（如光流或其他 :ref:`非 GPS 导航源 <common-non-gps-"
"navigation-landing-page>`），只要定位源工作正常，通过地面站设置 EKF 原点即可。这样就可以在室内使用 Loiter。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:33 f039a5f2675a43a28f472947183672e4
msgid ""
"When Coordinated Turns are enabled (via the ``LOIT_OPTIONS`` parameter, Bit "
"0), the aircraft modifies its commanded accelerations in Loiter mode to take"
" into account the requested yaw rate and current horizontal velocity. This "
"produces turns that feel more natural and “aircraft-like,” as the drone "
"banks into the turn to match the trajectory. Without this option, Loiter "
"turns are controlled purely by position and velocity demands, which can "
"result in a flat, sliding turn."
msgstr ""
"当启用协调转弯后（通过 ``LOIT_OPTIONS`` 参数的 Bit 0），飞机在 Loiter "
"模式下会根据请求的偏航角速率和当前水平速度来修正指令加速度。这样产生的转弯感觉更自然、更像固定翼飞机，机体会向转弯内侧压坡度以匹配轨迹。若不启用该选项，Loiter"
" 的转弯仅由位置和速度需求控制，可能产生平直的侧滑转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:38 72858d9ae7794c30bcffdc27a90fe528
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:43 1930127211884070886e62158466c081
msgid ""
"Loiter mode incorporates the altitude controller from AltHold mode. Details "
"for tuning :ref:`AltHold are on this wiki page <altholdmode_tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"Loiter模式集成了AltHold模式的高度控制器。AltHold的调参详情请参阅 :ref:`本wiki页面 "
"<altholdmode_tuning>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:47 fec184f222d244858d80b0e7b7fe68f3
msgid "Loiter Parameters"
msgstr "Loiter参数"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:49 e0dbd72088714795846227feff58d99c
msgid ""
":ref:`LOIT_OPTIONS <LOIT_OPTIONS>`: Enabling Coordinated Turns enables "
"Loiter mode to automatically include coordinated turn logic. This adjusts "
"the requested roll and pitch accelerations so that the vehicle’s motion "
"matches both the horizontal velocity vector and the commanded yaw rate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOIT_OPTIONS <LOIT_OPTIONS>`：启用协调转弯后，Loiter "
"模式会自动加入协调转弯逻辑。它会调整请求的横滚和俯仰加速度，使机体运动同时匹配水平速度矢量和指令偏航角速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:50 9c93926c2dbd4fa09c7d0bc252ec65a5
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`LOIT_SPEED_MS<LOIT_SPEED_MS>`: max horizontal speed in m/s"
msgstr ":ref:`LOIT_SPEED <LOIT_SPEED>`：最大水平速度，单位cm/s（即1250 = 12.5m/s）"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:51 3552c8cc109340c0af74440d2a7c6074
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`LOIT_ACC_MAX_M<LOIT_ACC_MAX_M>`: max acceleration in m/s/s.  Higher "
"values cause the copter to accelerate and stop more quickly"
msgstr ":ref:`LOIT_ACC_MAX <LOIT_ACC_MAX>`：最大加速度，单位cm/s/s。数值越大，飞机加速和停止越快。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:52 689e9d77acd34fd3b2d8923f6dc81701
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`LOIT_ANG_MAX <LOIT_ANG_MAX>`: max lean angle in degrees (i.e. 30deg)."
"  By default this value is zero which causes the "
":ref:`PSC_ANGLE_MAX<PSC_ANGLE_MAX>`  or :ref:`ATC_ANGLE_MAX<ATC_ANGLE_MAX>` "
"parameter's value to be used"
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOIT_ANG_MAX <LOIT_ANG_MAX>`：最大倾斜角（单位：度，例如30度）。默认值为零，此时将使用 "
":ref:`PSC_ANGLE_MAX<PSC_ANGLE_MAX>` 或 :ref:`ANGLE_MAX <ANGLE_MAX>` 参数的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:53 845cca2a9698488195941550291858d0
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`LOIT_BRK_ACC_M<LOIT_BRK_ACC_M>`: max acceleration in m/s/s while "
"braking (i.e. pilot has moved sticks to center).  Higher values will stop "
"the vehicle more quickly"
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOIT_BRK_ACCEL "
"<LOIT_BRK_ACCEL>`：制动时（即飞手将摇杆回中）的最大加速度，单位cm/s/s。数值越大，飞行器停止越快。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:54 f5372c675eff49c698516a31201e8280
msgid ""
":ref:`LOIT_BRK_DELAY <LOIT_BRK_DELAY>`: the delay in seconds before braking "
"starts once the pilot has centered the sticks"
msgstr ":ref:`LOIT_BRK_DELAY <LOIT_BRK_DELAY>`：飞手回中摇杆后开始制动的延迟时间（秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:55 4b1c06b457b541ee816937f79d41ce16
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`LOIT_BRK_JRK_M<LOIT_BRK_JRK_M>`: max change in acceleration in m/s/s/s"
" while braking.  Higher numbers will make the vehicle reach the maximum "
"braking angle more quickly, lower numbers will cause smoother braking"
msgstr ""
":ref:`LOIT_BRK_JERK "
"<LOIT_BRK_JERK>`：制动时的最大加速度变化率，单位cm/s/s/s。数值越大，飞行器越快达到最大制动角，数值越小，制动越平滑。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:56 1215fa7145c14d2fa49f2f83bec98984
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`PSC_NE_POS_P <PSC_NE_POS_P>`: (shown as \"Position XY (Dist to "
"Speed)\" at the top right of the screen shot above) converts the horizontal "
"position error (i.e difference between the desired position and the actual "
"position) to a desired speed towards the target position.  **It is generally"
" not required to adjust this**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PSC_POSXY_P <PSC_POSXY_P>`：（在上方截图右上角显示为\"Position XY (Dist to "
"Speed)\"）将水平位置误差（即目标位置与实际位置之差）转换为朝目标位置的期望速度。**通常无需调整此参数。**"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:57 2b45c0a513ab4b7a849ae5bfcf799fc7
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`PSC_NE_VEL_P<PSC_NE_VEL_P>` (shown as \"Velocity XY (Vel to Accel)\") "
"converts the desired speed towards the target to a desired acceleration.  "
"The resulting desired acceleration becomes a lean angle which is then passed"
" to the same angular controller used by :ref:`Stabilize mode <stabilize-"
"mode>`.  **It is generally not required to adjust this**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PSC_VELXY_P <PSC_VELXY_P>` （显示为\"Velocity XY (Vel to "
"Accel)\"）将朝目标位置的期望速度转换为期望加速度。由此得到的期望加速度将转换为倾斜角，然后传递给与 :ref:`Stabilize模式 "
"<stabilize-mode>` 相同的角度控制器。**通常无需调整此参数。**"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:61 7f848f1100ed4b3c85dbb8b990053750
msgid "Common Problems"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:63 f853da2fcb4d440da5b28fe2ee1225f2
msgid ""
"The vehicle `circles (aka \"toiletbowls\") "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a-3G9ZvXHhk>`__.  This is normally caused "
"by a compass problem the most likely being :ref:`magnetic interference "
"<common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>` from the power"
" cables under the autopilot.  Running :ref:`compassmot <common-compass-"
"setup-"
"advanced_compassmot_compensation_for_interference_from_the_power_wires_escs_and_motors>`"
" or purchasing a :ref:`GPS+compass module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-"
"compass-module>` normal resolves this.  Other possibilities include bad "
"compass offsets set during the :ref:`compass calibration process <common-"
"compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`."
msgstr ""
"飞行器 `绕圈（俗称\"马桶效应\"） "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a-3G9ZvXHhk>`__。这通常是罗盘问题引起的，最可能的原因是飞控下方电源线产生的"
" :ref:`磁干扰 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>`。运行 "
":ref:`compassmot <common-compass-setup-"
"advanced_compassmot_compensation_for_interference_from_the_power_wires_escs_and_motors>`"
" 或购买 :ref:`GPS+罗盘模块 <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` "
"通常可解决此问题。其他可能的原因包括 :ref:`罗盘校准 <common-compass-calibration-in-mission-"
"planner>` 时设置了错误的偏移量。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:71 b954d3efda2b4fb2b147514750ea2554
msgid ""
"The vehicle takes off in the wrong direction as soon as loiter is engaged.  "
"The cause is the same as #2 except that the compass error is greater than "
"90deg.  Please try the suggestions above to resolve this."
msgstr "进入Loiter模式后飞行器立即朝错误方向起飞。原因与第2条相同，但罗盘误差超过90度。请尝试上述建议来解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:75 bb4c45f89ccb4fc08ff9c98ecb980099
msgid "Verifying Loiter performance with dataflash logs"
msgstr "通过dataflash日志验证Loiter性能"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:77 83281dfdee484b28bd557e83c1574079
msgid ""
"Viewing the loiter's horizontal performance is best done by "
":ref:`downloading a dataflash log <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-"
"logs-in-mission-planner>` from your flight, then open it with the mission "
"planner and graph the NTUN message’s DesVelX vs VelX and DesVelY vs VelY.  "
"In a good performing copter the actual velocities will track the desired "
"velocities as shown below.  X = latitude (so positive = moving North, "
"negative = South), Y = longitude (positive = East, negative = West)."
msgstr ""
"查看Loiter水平性能的最佳方法是 :ref:`从飞行中下载dataflash日志 <common-downloading-and-"
"analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>`，然后用Mission "
"Planner打开并绘制NTUN消息中的DesVelX与VelX以及DesVelY与VelY的对比图。性能良好的飞机实际速度将跟踪期望速度，如下图所示。X=纬度（正值=向北移动，负值=向南），Y=经度（正值=向东，负值=向西）。"

#: ../../source/docs/loiter-mode.rst:82 2f5ec0a2ad0f485a9bbbfaf660c4a19f
msgid ""
"Checking altitude hold performance is the same as for :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode_verifying_althold_performance_with_dataflash_logs>` mode."
msgstr ""
"检查定高性能的方法与 :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode_verifying_althold_performance_with_dataflash_logs>` 模式相同。"

